            {
                "lineNumber": 235480,
                "originalJapaneseLine": "「分かった、助言を与えよう」",
                "translatedEnglishLine": "「Fine, I'll give you some advice.」"
            },
            {
                "lineNumber": 235481,
                "originalJapaneseLine": "「まず、毒の対策を考えたのは正解だ。",
                "translatedEnglishLine": "「First, thinking about poison countermeasures was correct."
